<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia jobless may keep falling - Treasury.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia jobless may keep falling - Treasury.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasury chief Ted Evans said on Monday the unemployment rate could continue falling below the 1997/98 (July-June) budget forecast of 8.0 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;I don't see any reason why unemployment can't continue to fall below the around 8.0 percent that we're forecasting for mid-next year,&quot; Evans told a parliamentary committee.</p>
</text>
